Package: soundsplitter
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, pipewire, pipewire-jack, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, libportaudio2, libpulse0, systemd | systemd-standalone-tmpfiles
Description: Split stereo audio between two output devices
 SoundSplitter routes left and right audio channels to separate devices,
 with independent delay adjustment and volume monitoring.
 This package contains a prebuilt Nuitka standalone application and uses
 the PipeWire JACK and PulseAudio compatibility services.
